'''Adrenaline''' is a [[buff]] that grants increased [[damage]], [[movement speed|movement]], [[attack speed|attack]] and [[cast speed]], and additional physical damage reduction. 

==Mechanics==
Adrenaline grants the following:
* {{c|mod|100% increased Damage}}
* {{c|mod|25% increased Attack, Cast, and Movement Speed}}
* {{c|mod|10% additional Physical Damage Reduction}}

Adrenaline cannot be gained or refreshed while you already have Adrenaline.

